wine32:i386 libvulkan1:i386 mesa-vulkan-drivers:i386
nvidia-detect thermald fancontrol i2c-tools evtest vainfo glmark2-x11 stress-ng
smartmontools nvme-cli hwdata sysstat
firmware-nvidia-graphics


